    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 53,
      "title": {
        "en": "Empathetic clinicians and helpful assistants"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A large number of clients express great appreciation for the veterinarians and support technicians, noting their bedside manner and thorough clinical care. Pet parents frequently mention that clinicians explain diagnosis options patiently and show genuine compassion. While an isolated reviewer experienced billing frustration, most describe an outstanding medical team."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 41,
      "title": {
        "en": "Comforting care for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how gentle and patient the medical staff are with nervous dogs and cats during exams. Multiple clients note that doctors take time to soothe fearful animals and make treatments as stress-free as possible. Aside from a single critical remark about boarding exercise routines, owners feel their companions are treated with loving care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 35,
      "title": {
        "en": "Organized clinic and examination rooms"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently mention that the hospital environment is tidy, well organized, and welcoming for visitors. Clients appreciate the clean examination rooms and dedicated clinic setup that comfortably accommodates pets. Reviewers feel the facility provides a calm and orderly environment for routine and urgent veterinary care."
      }
    }
  ],
